      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The trogg is a 5th level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save DC 12, +4 to hit with spell attacks). The trogg has the following shaman spells prepared: Cantrips (at will): <em>mold earth, shocking grasp, produce flame</em> 1st level (4 slots): <em>earth tremor, elemental shock<strong> </em>, chromatic orb, absorb elements<em> 2nd level (3 slots): </em>lava burst</strong> <em>, maximilian's earthen grasp</em><em> 3rd level (2 slot): </em>earthen spike, stinking cloud*</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
